## C1/C2 provisioned machine, update gating
W C1a PASS an unsigned CERTIFIED claim does not waive the Human Decision Gate -- {"certification": "UNCERTIFIED", "human_gate_required": true, "certification_basis": {"authenticated": false, "authenticated_status": null, "release_metadata_sha256": "66188a97e9c4d0d06d4a3899704c0f3002c6eedd706f6823cab29866411b41d4", "release_version": "4.1.6", "basis": "the signed release metadata binds no certification evidence; treated as uncertified", "unsigned_claim": "CERTIFIED", "unsigned_claim_disposition": "a request, recorded and ignored (D-0007 rule 2): an unsigned certification claim is treated as uncertified everywhere"}}
W C1b PASS `gov update --apply` stops at the gate; nothing is installed -- {"code": "HUMAN_GATE_REQUIRED", "lock_version": "4.1.5"}
W C2a PASS a certification bound by signed release metadata is authenticated against this machine's trust root -- {"certification": "CERTIFIED", "human_gate_required": false, "certification_basis": {"authenticated": true, "authenticated_status": "CERTIFIED", "release_metadata_sha256": "371e7f7d9cac5585818c12b484f975814b4dc9ec4568586db870e3a1ebe1a7a1", "release_version": "4.1.6", "basis": "certification status 'CERTIFIED' is bound by release metadata signed under the `release` role of this machine's trusted root (release.json sha256 371e7f7d9cac5585818c12b484f975814b4dc9ec4568586db870e3a1ebe1a7a1)", "unsigned_claim": "READY_FOR_INDEPENDENT_OS_VERIFICATION", "unsigned_claim_disposition": "a request, recorded and ignored (D-0007 rule 2): an unsigned certification claim is treated as uncertified everywhere"}}
W C2b PASS that authenticated certification — and only it — lets the update proceed without a gate -- {"ok": true, "applied": true, "code": null}

## C3 minting a certification claim
W C3a PASS no role can mint a CERTIFIED release; the refusal precedes any write -- {"orchestrator": {"code": "RELEASE_CERTIFICATION_REQUIRES_SIGNED_METADATA", "written": false}, "research-agent": {"code": "RELEASE_CERTIFICATION_REQUIRES_SIGNED_METADATA", "written": false}}
W C3b PASS a non-certifying status is still recorded (control) -- ok

## C4 framework.lock identity (a fresh provisioned machine: C2 raised the first machine's floor to 4.1.6)
W C4a PASS the forged unsigned release_commit is not recorded; the verified identity and its basis are -- {"release_commit": "25dac6efcc4a0d8149d12b619b1776788f34dcaf", "source": "release:agentic-engineering-os@4.1.5", "authenticity": "AUTHENTIC", "sequence": 11, "channel": "stable", "release_metadata_sha256": "8f8eaebda70994fe0e4b2bddb033a67897693f2725f317d600810b5a406f3e20"}
W C4b PASS a release commit bound by SIGNED metadata is recorded, with that basis -- {"release_commit": "ac00d0f9eba2c84eccfb041c7c8d8cc16c25da81", "basis": "bound by signed release metadata (evidence.provenance.release_commit) that this machine verified"}

